WEBVTT

00:00:03.214 --> 00:00:05.192
Open a report in the builder.

00:00:05.192 --> 00:00:09.544
On its Settings tab, the Group list holds every group, nested ones with

00:00:09.544 --> 00:00:13.274
their path, and No group leaves the report out of any group.

00:00:13.736 --> 00:00:18.158
Show in the admin menu adds the report under Reports, inside its group,

00:00:18.158 --> 00:00:20.168
for everyone who can open it.

00:00:20.168 --> 00:00:22.236
Choose the group, and tick it.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.823
Let people the report is shared with export it decides whether the people

00:00:26.823 --> 00:00:28.906
it is shared with can download it.

00:00:28.906 --> 00:00:31.613
Leave it off to let them view the report only.

00:00:31.613 --> 00:00:33.800
Click Publish to apply the settings.

00:00:34.282 --> 00:00:39.809
Under Reports, the Service group now holds Regional, and Regional holds the report.

00:00:39.809 --> 00:00:43.472
A report in no group is added directly under Reports.

